     "q": "For the data in the stem-and-leaf plot below showing the number of ice creams sold per day during the month of January, find:<br><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;color:#000;font-size:10.5pt;margin:1mm 0;width:auto\"><tr><th style=\"padding:.3mm 2.5mm;border-right:1.2px solid #000;border-bottom:1.2px solid #000\">Stem</th><th style=\"padding:.3mm 2.5mm;border-bottom:1.2px solid #000;text-align:left\">Leaf</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.3mm 2.5mm;border-right:1.2px solid #000;text-align:right\">4</td><td style=\"padding:.3mm 2.5mm;word-spacing:2mm\">0 1 3 5 7 9</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.3mm 2.5mm;border-right:1.2px solid #000;text-align:right\">5</td><td style=\"padding:.3mm 2.5mm;word-spacing:2mm\">2 5 5 7 8</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.3mm 2.5mm;border-right:1.2px solid #000;text-align:right\">6</td><td style=\"padding:.3mm 2.5mm;word-spacing:2mm\">2 3 3 5 7 7 9 9</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.3mm 2.5mm;border-right:1.2px solid #000;text-align:right\">7</td><td style=\"padding:.3mm 2.5mm;word-spacing:2mm\">3 5 6 7 8</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.3mm 2.5mm;border-right:1.2px solid #000;text-align:right\">8</td><td style=\"padding:.3mm 2.5mm;word-spacing:2mm\">2 4 6 7 8</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.3mm 2.5mm;border-right:1.2px solid #000;text-align:right\">9</td><td style=\"padding:.3mm 2.5mm;word-spacing:2mm\">3 6</td></tr></table><div style=\"font-size:9.5pt;color:#000\">Key: $4\\,|\\,0 = 40$</div><div><b>a</b>&nbsp; the range &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>b</b>&nbsp; the median</div>",
